    "description": "<h2><strong>Haier HSU-19 Gravity (INV) (Pro) (X6) Inverter Air Conditioner - 1.6 Ton</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Haier</p><img class=\"my-4 h-auto max-h-[420px] w-auto max-w-full rounded-md border border-border object-contain\" src=\"https://pub-49808a4ecaf04280b0561965cf5a40a4.r2.dev/uploads/2026/05/1779100526051-jnyjbm-haier-hsu-19-gravity-_inv_-_pro_-_x6_--inverter-air-conditioner---1.6-ton-price-in-bangladesh-6522.jpg\" alt=\"Haier-HSU-19-Gravity-(INV)-(Pro)-(X6)--Inverter-Air-Conditioner---1.6-Ton-Price-in-Bangladesh-6522\"><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"> HSU-19 Gravity (INV) (Pro) (X6) Inverter Air Conditioner can be a smart cooling solution for your home. It features a powerful 19000 BTU capacity that cools down large rooms very quickly. With advanced AI climate control and precise humidity features, it ensures you stay comfortable regardless of the weather outside. This AC is designed to save energy while providing top-notch performance. You can easily control it with your smartphone using the HaiSmart App. It is the perfect choice for a modern and cool lifestyle.</p><h3><strong>Smart AI Control</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">This AC features AI climate control and AI ECO modes for intelligent cooling. It automatically adjusts the temperature to keep your room comfortable while saving a lot of electricity.</p><h3><strong>Easy Remote Access</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The HaiSmart app allows you to control your AC from anywhere using a mobile phone. It can be turned on from anywhere, at any time.&nbsp;</p><h3><strong>Total Humidity Control</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Precise Humidity feature maintains the perfect moisture level in the air inside your room. It prevents the air from feeling too dry or too sticky for a better sleep experience.<br></p><h2><strong>Haier HSU-19 Gravity (INV) (Pro) (X6) Inverter Air Conditioner - 1.6 Ton Key Highlights</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Powerful 19000 BTU capacity ensures fast and effective cooling for rooms</p></li><li><p>AI Climate Control automatically manages settings for the best comfort level</p></li><li><p>HaiSmart App support lets you control the AC from your phone</p></li><li><p>Precise Humidity feature keeps the indoor air feeling fresh and balanced</p></li><li><p>Energy-saving ECO mode helps reduce your monthly electricity bill significantly</p></li><li><p>4-way swing provides even air distribution to every corner easily</p></li></ul><p></p>",
