    "description": "<h2><strong>Nothing Phone (4a) Pro</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Upgraded performance and refined design define the experience of the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"text-primary underline\" href=\"https://www.applegadgetsbd.com/brands/nothing\"><strong><u>Nothing</u></strong></a> Phone (4a) Pro. It is built with an aircraft-grade aluminum unibody and powered by the Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 processor. It delivers smooth performance for gaming, multitasking, and everyday productivity. Large 6.83-inch AMOLED display with a high refresh rate and up to 5000 nits peak brightness makes visuals incredibly sharp and vibrant even under strong sunlight. Paired with a powerful camera system and a reliable 5080 mAh battery with 50W fast charging, the Phone (4a) Pro balances style, speed, and practicality for modern smartphone users.</p><h3><strong>Flagship-Level Performance with Snapdragon 7 Gen 4</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Snapdragon 7 Gen 4 chipset, built on a 4nm process provides fast and efficient performance for demanding apps and multitasking. Combined with UFS 3.1 storage and up to 12GB RAM, the device delivers smooth responsiveness, quick app launches, and stable gaming performance.</p><h3><strong>Ultra-Bright 144Hz AMOLED Display</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">AMOLED panel offers a fluid 144Hz refresh rate and peak brightness up to 5000 nits. HDR10+ support and Ultra HDR imaging ensure vibrant colors, deep contrast, and excellent clarity whether you're streaming content, gaming, or browsing.</p><h3><strong>Advanced Camera System with Periscope Zoom</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Triple-camera setup features a 50MP main sensor with OIS, a 50MP periscope telephoto lens with 3.5x optical zoom, and an ultra-wide camera for expansive shots. It supports Dolby Vision HDR video recording and advanced imaging features for capturing detailed photos and cinematic videos.</p><h3><strong>Durable Design with Unique LED Interface</strong></h3><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br></p><h2><strong>Nothing Phone (4a) Pro Key Highlights</strong></h2><ul><li><p>Powerful processor deliver smooth performance in case of gaming and multitasking.</p></li><li><p>AMOLED display with 144Hz refresh rate provides ultra-smooth scrolling and fluid gameplay</p></li><li><p>Bright display ensures excellent outdoor visibility in bright sunlight</p></li><li><p>Triple-camera system with 3.5x optical zoom captures sharp photos and cinematic videos</p></li><li><p>Reliable front camera produces clear selfies and high-quality video calls</p></li><li><p>Large battery with 50W fast charging keeps the phone ready through long usage days</p></li><li><p>IP65 dust and water resistance improves durability for daily environments</p></li><li><p>Stereo speakers provide immersive audio for movies, games, and music</p><img class=\"my-4 h-auto max-h-[420px] w-auto max-w-full rounded-md border border-border object-contain\" src=\"https://pub-49808a4ecaf04280b0561965cf5a40a4.r2.dev/uploads/2026/05/1779088516527-abguc6-nothing-phone-_4a_-pro-price-in-bangladesh-6332.jpg\" alt=\"Nothing-Phone-(4a)-Pro-Price-in-Bangladesh-6332\"><p></p></li></ul><p></p>",
    "shortDescription": "The device features an aircraft-grade aluminum body and 137 individually addressable mini-LEDs on the back for unique notifications and visual alerts. With IP65 dust and water resistance and Gorilla Glass 7i protection, it is designed to handle everyday conditions with confidence.|",
